<!--
    The flowing N, drawn as an outline. Converted from svg-n-moving.svg.

    Unlike ic_konecta_wordmark.xml this path is stroked, not filled - fillColor
    stays transparent and the shape exists purely as a line, which is what gives
    it the light, drawn quality on the brand backdrop.

    strokeWidth is 4 rather than the 3 in the source: the path is 1126 units
    wide but renders a few hundred dp across on a phone, and 3 scaled down to a
    hairline that all but vanished.

    The colour is white so it can be tinted per instance - see
    fragment_onboarding.xml, which uses one in brand yellow and one barely-there
    white.
-->
